  ; ESTIMATE-NEXT:   S_NOP 0, implicit killed [[FLAT_LOAD_DWORDX4_4]], implicit killed [[FLAT_LOAD_DWORDX4_5]], implicit killed [[FLAT_LOAD_DWORDX4_6]], implicit killed [[FLAT_LOAD_DWORDX4_7]]
